EE103: LAB 04
Student: Phuong Dao
Professor: Yingjie Lao
Date: 11/18/2026

Objective: This lab uses HSPICE simulation to explore how transistor sizing 
and supply voltage affect a CMOS inverter's switching characteristics and propagation delay. 
This lab also utilized the optimization tool in HSPICE  to optimize a CMOS design 
with different goals, such as timing or threshold voltage.
